what you do?

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:09.542 align:start size:94% position:6%
Are your friends
proud of your success?

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:11.778 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think initially
they were like --

00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:13.013 line:92%
