the Hollywood of the East.

00:00:18.818 --> 00:00:20.286 line:92%
-Yeah. All the Marvel movies.

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:22.455 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All the Marvel movies
shoot there.

00:00:22.455 --> 00:00:24.624
There's so much movie production
there,

00:00:24.624 --> 00:00:28.094
