movie stars now.

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:28.628 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And I was like --

00:00:28.628 --> 00:00:31.898
My buddy Rob was like, "Hey,
let's play golf next weekend."

00:00:31.898 --> 00:00:34.534 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like,
"Great, I can bring Jon Hamm."

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:38.772 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's like, "Uh, okay."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.772 --> 00:00:41.875
And this was a good game though.
This was a fun outing.

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:43.643 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-What happened out here?

00:00:43.643 --> 00:00:49.049
-Well, actually, so, this is Rob
in the hat there.

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:51.818 size:81% position:41% line:92%
And he was down range.

00:00:51.818 --> 00:00:55.755
I hit a -- I should start by
saying I'm not a good golfer.

00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:59.659 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right. This story seems like
it's going that way.

00:00:59.659 --> 00:01:00.760 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:05.598 align:start size:94% position:6%
He was down range, and I just
lined up this 4-iron shot

00:01:05.598 --> 00:01:11.237
