00:01:13.206 --> 00:01:13.740 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, wow.

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:14.674 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Glorious bruise.

00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:15.341 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:01:15.341 --> 00:01:17.544 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I actually think you sent us
the bruise.

00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:20.580 align:start size:94% position:6%
I hope people can see it.
Yeah, you got him.

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:21.147 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Audience oohs ]

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:24.017 align:start size:94% position:6%
So maybe it's less about there
are movie stars in Atlanta.

00:01:24.017 --> 00:01:26.719 align:start size:94% position:6%
Maybe they're just not that
psyched you're back

00:01:26.719 --> 00:01:29.622 size:78% position:39%
'cause you hurt them.
-'Cause I hurt them?

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:30.757 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:31.458 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.458 --> 00:01:34.194 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah, that's true.

00:01:34.194 --> 00:01:36.463 align:start size:94% position:6%
